      "spam": false,
      "value": "I'm all for moderation, and monetization so VRchat can get more well deserved money to help pay to advance VRchat more... however...\n\nAs it stands right now, we can already make private instances that the owner CAN control, and to pay 10$ for something we already have would be pointless.\n\nA premium world maybe would allow for larger world designs, if anything.  Though that would mean putting a limit on world size for what we can do now.",
